meta {
  name: 23 Accept Sample (creates report)
  type: http
  seq: 23
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/accession/order-samples/{{sampleId}}/accept
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{operatorToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "sampleCondition": "Good",
    "notes": "Accepted for processing"
  }
}

docs {
  **Accept the sample — this is the step that makes the order machine-ready.**
  COLLECTED → ACCEPTED. Accepting **auto-creates the Technician `LabReport`
  (status PENDING)** for the order item — the exact row the analyzer fills in step
  27. Requires the `accession:in_house_order__accept_the_sample` permission granted
  to the operator in step 08.
}
